{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは生駒です。\n毎日暑いですね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんと暑い。\n信号待ちしてる時足こげるんじゃないかっておもうのですが(ﾟ⊿ﾟ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな生駒はお洋服の素晴らしさに目覚めました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから個別握手会の時楽しみにしててね。\nとりあえずスカートはくからね。\nボーイッシュも忘れないけどガーリーもよいよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりちゃん古着の良さを教えてくれてありがとうございます！\n今度は下北沢ねっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば若様が生駒を買い物に連れてってくれるとブログに書いてありましたな〜\nそれも楽しみ〜☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒やっと東京慣れて来たみたい！\nお買い物楽しい！\nもちろん二次元大好きよ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/25/3461963/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロッティーお誕生日おめでとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/25/3461963/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/25/3461963/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/25/3461963/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/25/3461963/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/25/3461963/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/25/3461963/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/25/3461963/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/25/3461963/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/25/3461963/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/25/3461963/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/25/3461963/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/25/3461963/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/25/3461963/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/25/3461963/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/25/3461963/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同い年だけど先に18歳になりましたね〜\nよく二人でNARUTOごっこするんです。\n生駒がナルトでロッティーはサスケ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロッティーはいつも元気でぴょんぴょん飛び回ってるのが可愛くてヽ(・∀・)ﾉ\nでもダンスと歌となったらガラッと変わって凄くかっこいい！\nほんと尊敬しています！これからもよろしく☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/25/3461963/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒今月のsmartさんにSKE48の松井玲奈さんとマドマギの企画でまどかちゃんコスで登場しております！\n玲奈さんと二次元について沢山喋りましたうれしヽ(・∀・)ﾉ\n玲奈さんのほむらちゃんがよすぎてずーっとガン見しておりました！\nコスプレは大好きです！\n生駒乃木坂にならなかったら今頃地元の二次元同好会のみなさんとコスプレのイベントとか行きまくっていました。\n将来の夢はコスプレイヤーさん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マドマギはぜひ一度見てみて下さい！\n普通の魔法少女の物語とは全く違うので新鮮ですよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではっ！\nへばなっ！"}],"source":"archive"}